        0,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8169,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "老婆婆用打火石為我們打了火石火花呢。",
  },
  "PictureBook_Line_0040:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        0,
        9,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        238,
        26,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8170,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "紫藤花家紋家族的人都是
不求回報地在支援鬼殺隊。",
  },
  "PictureBook_Line_0050:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        0,
        9,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        238,
        26,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8171,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "他們真的是很可靠的盟友。",
  },
  "PictureBook_Line_0060:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        0,
        9,
        17,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        63,
        5,
        0,
        0,
        238,
        26,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8172,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "似乎是某人的日記。",
  },
  "PictureBook_Line_0070:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        0,
        9,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        238,
        26,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8173,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "在鱗瀧師父底下修練的時候，
我也曾寫日記給禰豆子呢。",
  },
  "PictureBook_Line_0080:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        0,
        9,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        238,
        26,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8174,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "當時她一直不省人事，讓我很擔心……
幸好最後她順利恢復了意識……",
  },
  "PictureBook_Line_0090:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        0,
        9,
        17,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        63,
        5,
        0,
        0,
        238,
        26,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8175,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "看到仙貝就不自覺地
回想起以前的生活。",
  },
  "PictureBook_Line_0100:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        0,
        9,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        238,
        26,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8176,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "記得以前祭典結束後，
爹娘一定會烤給大家吃。",
  },
  "PictureBook_Line_0110:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        0,
        9,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        238,
        26,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8177,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "仙貝是用放比較久的麻糬搗碎做成的，
全家人都很喜歡吃。",
  },
  "PictureBook_Line_0120:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        0,
        9,
        17,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        63,
        5,
        0,
        0,
        238,
        26,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8178,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "是木炭，讓人不禁回憶起加入鬼殺隊之前的事……",
  },
  "PictureBook_Line_0130:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        0,
        9,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        238,
        26,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8179,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "那時候幾乎每天都在燒炭呢。",
  },
  "PictureBook_Line_0140:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        0,
        9,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        255,
        238,
        26,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
      ],
      "type": "Buffer",
    },
    "id": 8180,
    "idSub": 0,
    "message": "下山去到鎮上就會有很多人來買炭……
真的很感謝他們……",
  },
  "PictureBook_Line_0150:0" => {
    "attribute": {
      "data": [
        0,
        9,
        17,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        63,
        5,
        0,
        0,
        238,
        26,
        0,
